Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,点亮所有的节点与回路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,点名要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么连呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵，智障了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这，这只有一头只能在两端呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个肯定是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但这就下不来了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么反
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,草，有猪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这，这是两端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能在两端的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是没有在两端的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,居然是个几字形
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，怎么挤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,字形好诡异啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我也，我也想说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.61,0:01:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以抓吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不能抓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,中间围死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然后下面换一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看看，让我来操作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,居然是这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你在操作什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真的能操作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,南町nightin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的操作真随机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是，一般按到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,按道理来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,应该这两个就是在最两端的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它这里面没有办法连接任何东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,它只有一头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.49,0:02:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,中间的口下面换一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能听懂？中间的口下面换一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啥意思？哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个换也不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈，啥意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在下播之前就是这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这只要能玩玩赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个就算就能下播了，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,中间围死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这，啊哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是穷举出来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然不是了啊，真的啊哈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看到她赢的那一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能，我只能当做你是穷举出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈，不知道她怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是没懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是没看懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然她赢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然她做出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我还是没看懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她说天哪，研究生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,研究生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这下研究生了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人加在一起能比得上边牧不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你就说解没解开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,解没解开就完全运
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,穷举也是一种方法
